                                        "entry_id": "3ae2edd4-684b-39a9-9274-4a69202752ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Clothing that is suitable for wear by ordinary people, or in ordinary circumstances, as opposed to being unusual, uncomfortable, or otherwise difficult to wear."
